          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "结蜡 / 结垢预测业务问题",
          "html": "<p>清蜡周期按经验固定，结蜡快的井清不及时、结蜡慢的井过度作业；结垢位置难以预测。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 335\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"清洗周期成本\"><title>清洗周期成本</title><rect width=\"720\" height=\"335\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--card-soft)\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"><path d=\"M124 265H665\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"end\">-79211</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><path d=\"M124 211.25H665\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"216.25\" text-anchor=\"end\">207930</text><text x=\"259.25\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20.25</text><path d=\"M124 157.5H665\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"162.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">495071</text><text x=\"394.5\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">33.5</text><path d=\"M124 103.75H665\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"108.75\" text-anchor=\"end\">782212</text><text x=\"529.75\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">46.75</text><path d=\"M124 50H665\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"end\">1069353</text><text x=\"665\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">60</text><polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--jade)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" points=\"124,184.6800596567026 134.20754716981133,185.76577248268302 144.41509433962264,185.03726282705122 154.62264150943395,184.58479415103068 164.83018867924528,184.58843122913126 175.03773584905662,182.26065835591737 185.24528301886792,182.20361556137152 195.45283018867923,180.38183203551716 205.66037735849056,176.7202172584594 215.8679245283019,175.6431150808221 226.0754716981132,174.1521905897156 236.2830188679245,169.9076497775312 246.49056603773585,169.46928196615465 256.6981132075472,164.98965931150127 266.90566037735846,164.81419443823228 277.11320754716985,161.22001319477533 287.3207547169811,159.5489491440677 297.52830188679246,157.41882929476577 307.7358490566038,153.80034561340506 317.9433962264151,151.42950507702437 328.1509433962264,149.9099751359269 338.35849056603774,147.37483920534328 348.566037735849,143.73084314930986 358.7735849056604,138.83858621497708 368.9811320754717,139.28798146876858 379.188679245283,137.5522768507564 389.39622641509436,135.11865942773713 399.60377358490564,131.94331080258604 409.811320754717,127.95433006957683 420.0188679245283,123.06281719599036 430.22641509433964,123.70272727312508 440.4339622641509,122.3869436823405 450.64150943396226,120.63102938523059 460.8490566037736,118.44042475214192 471.0566037735849,115.80596306719534 481.2641509433962,112.70372819033298 491.47169811320754,109.09679200631516 501.6792452830189,104.93863439575307 511.8867924528302,100.17786637485682 522.0943396226414,101.05290168514367 532.3018867924528,100.13409953654823 542.5094339622642,98.93450201807838 552.7169811320755,97.46933334176984 562.9245283018868,95.7521875250151 573.132075471698,93.79380094177236 583.3396226415094,91.60101228963103 593.5471698113208,89.17597734109518 603.7547169811321,86.51568831376943 613.9622641509434,83.61182765193831 624.1698113207547,80.45096506154508 634.377358490566,77.01508616660357 644.5849056603773,73.28242222197957 654.7924528301887,69.22853365011764 665,64.82758620689654\"/><circle cx=\"134.20754716981133\" cy=\"185.76577248268302\" r=\"6\" fill=\"var(--clay)\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><text class=\"plot-x-label\" x=\"394.5\" y=\"324\" text-anchor=\"middle\">间隔 / 天</text><text class=\"plot-y-label\" x=\"24\" y=\"157.5\" transform=\"rotate(-90 24 157.5)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">180天教学成本</text></g></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 1</b><span>清洗后的沉积状态下降形成锯齿曲线；周期—成本曲线展示过于频繁与过于稀疏清洗的取舍。该曲线由逐天模拟累计，不是预填最优周期。图中是初始参数的固定种子教学计算，交互演示可重新计算。</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "沉积状态与周期搜索",
          "html": "<p>结蜡和结垢都会增加流动阻力，清洗间隔需要同时权衡产量损失和作业支出。本例把温差与含蜡条件引起的积累、含水相关的结垢代理分别计入日沉积状态，在清洗日降低状态，再累计损失油量与费用。这一状态模拟与离散搜索承担AI维护流程的可解释计划环节，自动找出给定参数下总成本较低的周期。</p><p>候选成本 · 推荐；横轴：间隔 / 天；纵轴：180天教学成本。</p><p>系统批量比较7—60天共54种清洗间隔，交付候选周期、模拟期内清洗次数、累计损失成本以及当前周期对照，减少逐个修改间隔后手动汇总的环节。沉积曲线显示每次清洗后的恢复与再次累积，成本曲线则揭示加密作业是否值得。生产人员据此比较相邻候选，结合班组和物资安排选择待执行的维护计划。</p><p><b>默认教学计算枚举7—60天共54种清洗间隔，最低成本对应8天。相同180天模拟期内，30天间隔的油量损失与清洗合计成本为59.48万教学元，8天间隔为34.41万教学元，下降42.15%。</b></p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "清洗井史与恢复标签",
          "html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">试点整理20—30口井的连续生产和清洗记录，包含流动温度、析蜡温度、含蜡量、含水率、日产油、清洗日期及单次费用。清洗前后的产量恢复幅度和持续时间，是校准积累速率与去除效果的重要依据，应与作业内容一起核对。本例用显式沉积参数演示180天计划，清洗日保留原状态的12%。</p><div class=\"checklist\"><div class=\"cl-head\"><span>数据准备清单 · 5 项</span><span class=\"cl-prog\"><span id=\"cl-txt\">0 / 5</span><span class=\"cl-bar\"><i id=\"cl-fill\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"0\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--card)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">生产与温度压力数据</span><span class=\"cl-s\">日度</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">无需标注</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"1\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--card)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">清蜡 / 除垢记录</span><span class=\"cl-s\">时间、方式、效果</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">作为标签</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"2\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--card)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">原油物性</span><span class=\"cl-s\">含蜡量、析蜡点</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">关键特征</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"3\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--card)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">人工复核记录</span><span class=\"cl-s\">保留复核对象、原始证据与修订结论</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">温度、含蜡含水、清洗日期、产量及费用</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"4\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--card)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">样本版本与评价明细</span><span class=\"cl-s\">按原始对象分组，保留评价记录与版本</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">用于复查数值和追踪更新</span></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">专业资料与数据依据</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/en/Terms/s/scale\">SLB：结垢<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"https://www.slb.com/products-and-services/innovating-in-oil-and-gas/reservoir-characterization/rock-and-fluid-analysis/fluid-analysis/composition-analysis\">SLB：流体组分与析蜡温度<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "沉积机理与恢复差异",
          "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:2px\"><span class=\"dtag\" data-d=\"中\">难度 中</span><span class=\"small muted\">沉积速率和清洗恢复程度需要用井史标定</span></div><div class=\"meter\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"\"></i></div><p>难点在于蜡与无机盐沉积的成因不同，相同含水或温度条件下，各井的积累速度和清洗恢复程度仍可能差异很大。筹备时应结合原油性质、水质和作业方式区分井组，优先用同井清洗前后的变化标定参数。费用口径也会影响周期选择，需要把油量损失和单次作业支出统一计量，检查推荐周期对参数变化的敏感性。</p><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">可借鉴的通用技术</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/ts\">风险预测<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/ts\">生存分析<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/ts\">特征归因<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
